37
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,000
 You can see that we instantly get some more cool reflections to the scene.

38
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:44,000
 And I usually want to add the sun to almost a 90 degrees angle.

39
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,000
 So I don't want it to be straight down.

40
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,000
 I don't want it to be right forward but just about there.

41
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,000
